The deploy failed because `onAfterUpdate` is not an overridable hook in this fflib build (the after‑update event isn't dispatched to a method of that name), whereas `onAfterInsert` and `onBeforeUpdate` are. I've therefore moved the "stage changed to Closed Won" check into `onBeforeUpdate` (where `Trigger.oldMap` and the record Ids are still available) and kept the "inserted as Closed Won" check in `onAfterInsert` (so the newly created records already carry their Ids). Both qualify at most one `startFulfilment` call per invocation, with all qualifying Ids batched.

